  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-pERgtFSG\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-IYeXjXMO\">SDK简介</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-NVk1GLl4\">欢迎使用巨量引擎开放平台开发者套件（SDK），当前支持<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083420135496\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">Java</a>&nbsp;和<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083436761088\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">Go</a>两个开发语言，后续会逐步扩展其他语言，有相关语言诉求也欢迎反馈给我们</p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-5qmjrFq6\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-ca8U3fRi\">SDK开源</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-h00MFcOH\">SDK现已处于公测阶段，并已在<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/oceanengine/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">github</a>上开源，欢迎广大开发者能够参与进来，一起让SDK更好用！</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-ehKaSLf8\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6HD8IGFY\">Java：<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/oceanengine/ad_open_sdk_java\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">https://github.com/oceanengine/ad_open_sdk_java</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PBUnXDQb\">Go：<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/oceanengine/ad_open_sdk_go\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">https://github.com/oceanengine/ad_open_sdk_go</a></p></blockquote><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-cLAOkLAi\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-8M9OSSc5\">为什么选择 SDK</h2><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-eEmJYRYU\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-la7mZTeP\">更快、更顺畅的集成：SDK 可帮助您简化集成流程，从而减少集成时间。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WRUmaKeE\">更轻松的代码维护：SDK 通过提供可在不同项目中重复使用的预构建组件、函数和库，使您可以轻松维护代码。这可以节省开发和维护软件应用程序的时间和精力，同时确保代码库的一致性和质量。</li></ul><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-wtA9zbpP\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-VjTCE2T3\">SDK支持的接口</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-mUIe8dV4\">当前SDK已支持全量接口能力</p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "SDK使用介绍"
}
